{"id": "Dd_tRbkP0qO", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"VIDEO\" to get this AI production studio.\n\nThis free AI tool turns your Claude Code into a full production studio.\n\nAnd it's completely free.\n\nIt's called Open Montage.\n\nIt's a fully open source project with over 61k stars on GitHub.\n\nIt basically works like a real production team.\n\nWith a researcher, a scriptwriter, a voice artist, and an editor, all run by AI.\n\nYou just give it a prompt.\n\nAnd a team of AI agents searches the web.\n\nIt writes the script and generates the visuals.\n\nIt pulls real B roll and adds music, voiceovers, and sound effects.\n\nThen it puts everything together into a finished video, all on its own.\n\nAnd it works for pretty much any format.\n\nFrom animated explainers and product ads to UGCs and even cinematic trailers.\n\nThink of it like hiring a whole video agency that lives inside your terminal.\n\nNo hiring editors, no juggling five different tools, no waiting days for a first draft.\n\nOne prompt kicks off the whole pipeline from research to final cut.\n\nYou stay in the director's chair while the team handles everything else.\n\n#openmontage #githubrepo #claudecode #aivideos #opensourceai", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1790951623, "like_count": 3766, "comment_count": 7078, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1102387012636726a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.794, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNIZ0mXcwddJ4w2k0orxtuFc_e246tEcs2aWgxfQJYrab-Zs2hef8VvvvHaadQlHXF0JFGSpb-q8_bErTiVrPsm5oSemvWJsHg4RMI.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_oc=Adr0p4kH2rhB5dBqK6-fKO1gejQ8W9jKUJOsg7B6Iz8prkPSqw2nlcXuB7wJGXRjev8&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=w8sSr_zRXcAQ7kNvwGX6eeT&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&